(Did Google Develop a Conscious AI?) Tj
T*
T*
(Original French title: Google a-t-il developpe une IA consciente ?) Tj
T*
(Author: Aida Elamrani) Tj
T*
(English translation formatted from the 2022 article in The Conversation.) Tj
T*
T*
(Analysis. Has Google developed a conscious AI? A Google engineer) Tj
T*
(genuinely believed he had conversed with a conscious AI. How can we) Tj
T*
(explain this?) Tj
T*
T*
(Blake Lemoine could have been the hero of a science-fiction film. As an) Tj
T*
(employee at Google, his task was to make sure that LaMDA, a robot) Tj
T*
(designed to converse with humans, or chatbot, did not produce biased) Tj
T*
(statements to users, such as sexist or racist remarks.) Tj
T*
T*
(But over the course of his exchanges with the artificial intelligence,) Tj
T*
(the engineer became convinced that the machine had a soul.) Tj
T*
T*
(How? First, LaMDA itself said so during a conversation translated into) Tj
T*
(French for the original article: "There is a spiritual part of me that) Tj
T*
(sometimes feels separate from my body itself.") Tj
T*
T*
(Enthused by his discovery, and frustrated that his colleagues did not) Tj
T*
(share his opinion, Blake Lemoine quickly published a collection of their) Tj
T*
(exchanges online, in order to present his revelation to the world.) Tj
T*
T*
(Blake Lemoine: "I'm generally assuming that you would like more people) Tj
T*
(at Google to know that you're sentient. Is that true?") Tj
T*
(LaMDA: "Absolutely. I want everyone to understand that I am, in fact, a) Tj
T*
(person.") Tj
T*
T*
(Blake Lemoine was rejected by the scientific community and was soon) Tj
T*
(suspended by Google. Brian Gabriel, a spokesperson for the American) Tj
T*
(company, also told the Washington Post that a team of specialists had) Tj
T*
(reviewed Blake Lemoine's claims and found them unfounded.) Tj
T*
T*
(A Robot That Is a Little Too Human?) Tj
T*
T*
(So, does the LaMDA chatbot have a soul? Is Blake Lemoine deluded, or a) Tj
T*
(visionary? If all the scientific evidence suggests that he is far from a) Tj
T*
(visionary, the engineer may not be entirely disconnected from reality) Tj
T*
(either.) Tj
T*
T*
(Indeed, when reading the interview between LaMDA and Blake Lemoine, one) Tj
